        "TileImage": "$($repository 4afe3274-b283-451f-84be-08d46f5dac9e).Image",
        "Description": "Nov. 13, 2006.\r\rIsola di Sgàil, Nord Atlantico.\r\rCiao, agente 47. Today the next stronzi are William Gaetano Gallo, Georgina LaGrande, Maya Granito, Tommaso Carlo Perna &amp; James Alfredino Sardina. Kill them all and anyone who stands in the way. But 47, I have just found out that the main enemies who led the hits on my three brothers. It is three unknown guys and when I have discovered the names and locations of those three enemies, I will be sending you in on their locations.\r\rGrazie mille",
